      "text": "#Top5Balita | MARCH 5, 2026\n\n• Bumilis ang inflation ng bansa sa 2.4% nitong Pebrero, ayon sa Philippine Statistics Authority.\n\nREAD:\n- https://t.co/1JOcZMIXf1\n- https://t.co/vPzWJixCMb\n\n• Tatlong dating kawani ng gobyerno ang nabistong nag-eespiya para sa China.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/B1Za6Oc4VR\nREAD: https://t.co/TiZU37JXYO\n\n• Sinampahan ni dating senador Sonny Trillanes ng perjury at incriminating an innocent person ang 18 \"ex-marines,\" kasama sina Mike Defensor at Atty. Levito Baligod.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/NukFLQVvG2\nREAD: https://t.co/RMsrTmt7lT\n\n• Tinawag ni Interior Sec. Jonvic Remulla na makapal ang mukha ni Bureau of Fire Protection (BFP) Chief Jesus Fernandez, na inireklamo dahil sa pagtanggap umano ng P14 milyong kickback.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/1g9kVoe8iv\nREAD: https://t.co/8XpMPkrIPe\n\n• Pormal nang sinampahan ng ethics complaint ng Gabriela Women's Party si Quezon City Rep. Bong Suntay dahil sa anila'y \"macho\" at \"sexist\" na pahayag ukol kay Anne Curtis.\n\nWATCH: https://t.co/gMcevC9Bie\nREAD: https://t.co/nTdUxIoJOj",
